    <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="section" dg:origin="1 240 1228 2310 1892">
      <dg:chunk dg:structure="header" dg:origin="1 240 1228 1026 1271" dg:style="font-weight: bold; color: darkslategray">
        <dg:chunk dg:structure="lim" dg:origin="1 240 1228 277 1271">1.</dg:chunk> Financial and Operational Narrative</dg:chunk>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1327 2310 1367; 1 240 1386 2310 1426; 1 240 1446 2310 1485; 1 240 1505 1844 1545">Throughout the third quarter of 2146, the Xanadu Highlands facility maintained full compliance with all affirmative and negative covenants defined in the Secured Credit Agreement (Document 3A). Our main subsurface geothermal tap operated with exceptional stability, posting a quarterly average Cryo-Geothermal Tap Integrity Index (CGTII) of <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="93.4" dg:origin="1 240 1505 364 1545">93.4%</docset:CovenantThreshold>, which remains comfortably above the <docset:CovenantThreshold xsi:type="decimal" dg:value="85.0" dg:origin="1 1039 1505 1151 1545">85.0%</docset:CovenantThreshold> threshold mandated in Section 4.01(1).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
      <docset:OperationalNarrative dg:structure="p" dg:origin="1 240 1615 2310 1654; 1 240 1674 2310 1713; 1 240 1733 2310 1773; 1 240 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 1327 1892">Ammonia synthesis volume averaged <docset:AnnualCommodityYield dg:origin="1 913 1615 1646 1654">26,450 metric tons per Titan sidereal day</docset:AnnualCommodityYield>, successfully achieving the Ammonia Synthesis Target specified in Section 4.01(2). As a result of maintaining our core structural safety parameters, the floating interest rate remained at the base level of <docset:InterestRate dg:origin="1 1149 1733 1505 1773" dg:style="font-weight: bold">TIDOR plus 5.25%</docset:InterestRate>, and the Thermal Risk Penalty Premium was not applied. Furthermore, our escrow balances in the Environmental Reclamation Reserve were maintained at <docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve dg:origin="1 2255 1793 2310 1832; 1 240 1852 471 1892" xml:id="restrictedescrowreserve">SC 250,000,000</docset:RestrictedEscrowReserve>, fully meeting the requirement of Section 4.01(3).</docset:OperationalNarrative>
    </docset:OperationalNarrative>
